WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Last Decisive Battle!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Kouki's Ultimate Evolution

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.450
The Last Decisive Battle!

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.550
Kouki's Ultimate Evolution!

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.340
Charge, troops!

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.860
Kurata's assault on ElDoradimon has begun.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.090
Blue Prominence!

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.540
Forbidden Temptation!

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.130
What?!

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.730
What are you doing over there?!

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:10.650
This is...

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:13.110
A space-time oscillation bomb!

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.320
What?

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:17.010
It's showtime!

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:22.770
With Masaru and the others' defensive battles in vain,

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:26.140
the space-time oscillation bomb, that Kurata set up, exploded.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:34.380
Crossing through the dimensional rift, ElDoradimon was transported to the human world.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.500
This is...

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.610
the human world?!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.500
ElDoradimon is...

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.410
in the human world...

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.850
Unbelievable...

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.240
The human world?

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.680
No way...

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.470
Our home...

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:28.390
This is the end!

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:29.560
Calm down!

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.940
Don't break up your ranks!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.800
Oh no.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.050
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.840
Forbidden Temptation!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:46.620
Are you all right?

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:47.540
T-Thank you.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.100
Baromon.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.630
We must do whatever it takes to hold our ground.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:54.790
As long as we continue to have hope, an open path <i>will</i>  be available to us!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.830
Baromon, you should settle down the rest of our companions!

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.260
If there's unrest amongst the troops, we won't win a battle we can win!

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.830
Besides, that muscular idiot will be here soon.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.220
You mean Masaru?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.600
Yes!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.230
We still have Suguru's son with us!

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.160
Suguru's son will take care of this somehow!

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.940
We haven't lost yet!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.090
But...

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.380
ElDoradimon has fallen into the human world.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.920
What the hell is Kurata thinking?

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.040
Where's ElDoradimon?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.140
Over there!

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.620
We can't stay here.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.320
Let's go!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.130
Yeah!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.530
Oh, you're not getting away that easy.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.070
Let's settle this, Daimon Masaru.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.110
Masaru.

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.160
Ikuto, go on without me.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:12.750
But...

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.950
We'll take care of him.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.580
Leave this to us.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:19.610
Okay.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.150
Let's go, Yatagaramon.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.880
Here we go, Daimon...

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.420
MASARU!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.770
That bastard Kouki...

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.190
There's something different about him this time!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.460
I'll show you what it is!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.990
My new power!

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:57.010
Hyper Bio Extra Evolution!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:03.460
BioDarkdramon!

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:13.390
BioDarkdramon

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:13.390
Ultimate Level

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.650
BioDarkdramon.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.850
A Bio Hybrid type formed from the fusion of a human and a Digimon.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.980
His special attack is Dark Roar.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:13.390
It pulverizes the enemy with its brutal energy!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.040
That guy...

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.320
He evolved to a higher Level!

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:21.850
Aniki, let's evolve too!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.310
Digisoul Charge!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.740
Overdrive!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.930
Agumon, evolve!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.390
ShineGreymon!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.680
Roses Rapier!

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.720
Gale Claw!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.370
They did it!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.510
Rosemon!

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.520
MirageGaogamon!

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.950
Can you still fight, Rosemon?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.010
Of course.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.160
There's no time for complaints.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.420
Besides, there's more coming!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.830
All right! We'll fight, too!

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:32.650
Pumpmon, come back!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.470
Trick or Treat!

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.160
Trick or Treat!

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.670
All right!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.790
We got them!

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.540
Not bad!

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:01.950
Currently, the enemy suppression rate is at 37%.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.640
Gizmon:XT loss rate at 4%.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.850
They must be just as desperate.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.250
Throw the XT beta army at the enemy Ultimate Levels.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.280
Kouki-kun will continue to keep ShineGreymon busy.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:19.280
Enemy suppression rate has risen to 40%!

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.730
It's about time.

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.330
Shift the operation to the second stage.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:24.950
Roger!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:24.950
Roger!

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.580
DHS functioning!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.350
Energy supply has commenced!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.300
Javelin's Core is on the move!

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:57.870
MASARU!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.870
I won't let you!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.580
ShineGreymon!

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.040
Aniki, hurry!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.980
Yeah!

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:07.530
This is a live report!

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:11.970
The monsters who are threatening us have suddenly intruded into the gulf coast!

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:16.850
Right now, a weapon designed by Professor Kurata to protect us is on its way.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:19.710
I repeat, this is a live report!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:23.720
They're making it sound like Kurata is a defender of justice.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:24.490
Shh!

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.690
We're still wanted criminals.

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:32.890
The government has declared their full support to Professor Kurata in his efforts to resolve this problem.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.650
Also, because it is anticipated that a devastating battle will take place in this area,

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.650
I wonder if Masaru-niichan and the others have come back.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:39.870
all of its citizens are urged to find shelter at once.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.690
Masaru...

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.050
Now, ShineGreymon!

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:04.390
Yeah!

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:05.880
What?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:09.850
Glorious...!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.360
Go ahead and shoot!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.230
Do it if you've got the guts.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.370
He's using the buildings as a shield!

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.110
That's dirty, Kouki!

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.540
Dumbass!

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.160
There's nothing clean or dirty in a fight!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.640
Also, let me tell you something else.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.530
You aren't able to attack me,

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.810
but I can attack you as much as I want!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.340
Gigastic Lance!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.090
ShineGreymon!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.170
Hurry, this way!

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.470
MirageGaogamon!

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:14.630
Yes, Master!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.420
Gale Claw!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.970
Thanks, you're a big help.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:24.140
Don't let your guard down.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:28.860
That's...

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:38.530
What is that?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.120
Commence the Digital Hazard System.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.450
Gawappunch!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.460
Baromon!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.170
What is this?!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.630
ElDoradimon!

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.370
STOP!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:13.770
Don't put ElDoradimon through any more pain!

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:15.050
Get down!

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:16.010
Baromon!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:21.910
Oh, no!

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:23.150
Baromon!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.820
Baromon-sama!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.820
Baromon-sama!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:29.740
T-Tell Suguru's son...

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:33.470
to take care... of ElDoradimon...

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.140
You...!

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:44.470
DJ Shooter!

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.960
What is that?

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:54.370
They've chained down ElDoradimon.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.170
Rosemon!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.350
MirageGaogamon!

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.310
Destroy those ships!

00:12:58.310 --> 00:12:59.460
Master, look at that!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.870
What now?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.360
What is Kurata trying to do?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.130
DHS in expansion!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.100
All sections, all green!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.010
Start forming the Gizmon Javelin!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.700
It's a large flock of Gizmon!

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.320
What the hell is going on?

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.890
Master, your orders!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.480
We'll have to take care of both of them.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:11.150
MirageGaogamon, you take care of the ones in the sky!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:13.760
Rosemon, destroy those ships!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.390
Roger!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.390
Roger!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.940
What's wrong, Daimon Masaru?

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.480
You finished already?

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.550
Don't look down on me!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.450
Come down!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.310
I'll kick your ass!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.670
Babble all you want, loser!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:44.840
Did I get him?

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.430
Aniki, are you okay?

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.080
Thanks!

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.050
Hey hey, being all chumly, are we?

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.260
You make me puke!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.470
Think you've got time to do that bullshit anyway?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.410
Look over there.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:02.900
What?

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.440
Wh-What is that?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:13.160
A weapon made specifically against ElDoradimon.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.830
The Gizmon Javelin.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:20.330
Once that's completed, ElDoradimon is dead meat.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:22.340
Wha'cha gonna do?

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.790
Daimon Masaru!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.520
ShineGreymon!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:36.100
Aniki, my Glorious Burst will level the whole city with it!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:37.970
What should we do?

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.020
Damn it!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.980
Daimon Masaru, you are powerless.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:46.490
Bite your nails while you watch ElDoradimon disappear!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.550
After that, I'll savor my time beating y-

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.340
No thanks.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.810
I've got no plans to stand by and watch this happen!

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:57.440
No matter how many times I've fallen, I'll stand right back up again!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.410
Again and again!

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:03.370
As long as there's still a possibility, I'll never give up!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.210
You are going down!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.890
I feel it...

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.610
A new power...

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.220
GeoGrey...

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.200
Sword!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.710
A new power...

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.200
So what?!

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.090
What power!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.840
I can use this!

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:02.290
Now I can fight without dragging the city into it!

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:07.760
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:07.760
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.650
ShineGreymon!

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:06.380
Pay him back for everything he's done, with interest!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:07.840
Gotcha, Aniki!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:12.720
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:12.720
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.830
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.830
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:18.450
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:18.450
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.770
You cut through me!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:23.260
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:23.260
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.330
Unforgivable.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.240
That's unforgivable, damn it!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:26.330
All of you will die!

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.220
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.220
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:30.510
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:30.510
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.340
What?

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:35.780
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:35.780
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:35.240
Dark Roar!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:41.580
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:41.580
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:47.600
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:47.600
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.440
N-No way!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.350
He deflected it!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.810
Go, ShineGreymon!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.850
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.850
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:51.230
This is the end!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.140
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.140
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:52.660
Cut the bullshit!

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:53.990
This won't end.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:58.410
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:58.410
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.730
It'll never end!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.300
Not until I beat you!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:04.210
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:04.210
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:10.380
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:10.380
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:14.950
ShineGreymon!

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:15.420
Aniki!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.600
What was that?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.090
That light...

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.640
Aniki, let's go stop that javelin!

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.600
Yeah, you're right!

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.900
BioDarkdramon's signal has died out.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.990
I see.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.730
Kouki-kun lost.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:39.470
But this match...

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.400
Gizmon Javelin formation has completed.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.730
It's ready to go anytime.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.120
...is our victory.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.260
What is that?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.500
ShineGreymon, we've gotta destroy that thing!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.110
Yeah!

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:17.970
That's...!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.550
It's Masaru-niichan!

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:26.200
Drop the Gizmon Javelin.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:19.640
ElDoradimon's signal has disappeared!

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:21.260
Mission complete!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:25.210
All Gizmon will be directed to gather the energy from its remains.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.140
Now...

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:32.060
all of my preparations are complete.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:38.480
We couldn't stop it in the end.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:41.240
We were useless.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.070
Not yet!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:43.510
Masaru!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.980
The battle's not over yet!

